      "content": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p>\n<p>Statement I : For KI, molar conductivity increases steeply with dilution</p>\n<p>Statement II : For carbonic acid, molar conductivity increases slowly with dilution</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "<b>Statement I is false :</b> KI is a strong electrolyte\nwhich gets completely dissociate on dissolution.\nOn dilution, the molar conductivity almost\nremain constant.\n<br><br><b>Statement II is false :</b> carbonic acid is a weak\nelectrolyte which do not gets completely\ndissociate on dissolution. On dilution the molar\nconductivity of weak electrolyte increases\nsharply.<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 27th July Evening Shift Chemistry - Electrochemistry Question 106 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l7oid6ka/8bb7bbea-eda2-4c6f-9399-9a524b8ee42a/c41c44b0-2cf5-11ed-a627-29822045a51b/file-1l7oid6kb.png?format=p